    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n36932" root="كسب" body-key="k">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَسَابِ</span></b>  The <i>wolf.</i> (L, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <i>A name of a
bitch:</i> (S:) <i>one of the names of the bitch:</i>
(ISd:) as also ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَسْبَةُ</span></b> : (K:) as ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كُسَيْبٌ</span></b>  is
<i>a name of the dog;</i> i. e., of the male: (K:)
names thus used as ominous of gain, [or of
capturing game]: (IM:) <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَسَابِ</span>, as <i>a name of
a hunting bitch,</i> means <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَاسِبَةٌ</span>. (TA, art. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">برح</span>.)

